[node name="PageSprite2" type="Sprite2D" parent="Handbook Button/Handbook Window" unique_id=248034303]
visible = false
position = Vector2(300, 200)
texture = ExtResource("5_xxilg")

[node name="LeftPageText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Handbook Button/Handbook Window/PageSprite2" unique_id=1308254568]
offset_left = -280.0
offset_top = -188.0
offset_right = -24.0
offset_bottom = 188.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/line_separation = -1
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b]Introduction[/b][/center]

Greetings, apprentice!

This mystic tome is for those who wish to identify magical artifacts. It is no simple task, but fret not! This guide shall bestow the ABCs upon ye!

When encountering a magic item, simply:

[ol]
[u]Always[/u] check for [b]curses[/b]!
Identify what [b]family[/b] of artifact it is, and turn to that page.
Remember, every item has a history. [u]If a story doesn’t align with what you observe, then that item could be suspicious[/u].
If everything seems correct, then you have a true magic item!
[/ol]"

[node name="RightPageText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Handbook Button/Handbook Window/PageSprite2" unique_id=283982207]
offset_left = 24.0
offset_top = -188.0
offset_right = 280.0
offset_bottom = 188.0
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/line_separation = -1
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b]Curses[/b][/center]

Beware cursed items!

Many artifacts found in the wild could subject their wielders to ill effects, and some scoundrels even try to pawn them off onto others! 

[ul]
The sure signs of cursed magics are as follows:
[b]Mysterious whispers[/b] coming off it.
A clearly [b]evil-looking[/b] design.
The colour [color=purple]purple[/color]! As any good apprentice knows, all purple things are surely evil!
[/ul]

Never accept an item with these attributes under [u]any circumstance[/u]!
"

[node name="PageSprite3" type="Sprite2D" parent="Handbook Button/Handbook Window" unique_id=950058420]
visible = false
position = Vector2(300, 200)
texture = ExtResource("6_nqi3i")

[node name="LeftPageText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Handbook Button/Handbook Window/PageSprite3" unique_id=2056636873]
offset_left = -280.0
